  "solution": "The logic followed here is :-\n\nBy using BODMAS RULE :\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/4671232025562bc3ba9a781319d633acf8cd8e78dc8e96912cd7564a7df4717d.png] \n\nOption 1) : × and ÷\n\nGiven equation is : 110 ÷ 20 + 5 × 13 - 9 = 153\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 110 × 20 + 5 ÷ 13 - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ 110 × 20 + __**5 ÷ 13**__ - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**110 × 20**__ + 0.3846 - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**2200 + 0.3846**__ - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**2200.3846 - 9**__ = 153\n\n⇒ 2191.3846 ≠ 153\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) : ÷ and +\n\nGiven equation is : 110 ÷ 20 + 5 × 13 - 9 = 153\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 110 + 20 ÷ 5 × 13 - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ 110 + __**20 ÷ 5**__ × 13 - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ 110 + __**4 × 13**__ - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**110 + 52**__ - 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**162 - 9**__ = 153\n\n⇒ **153 = 153**\n\n**LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 3) : - and ×\n\nGiven equation is : 110 ÷ 20 + 5 × 13 - 9 = 153\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 110 ÷ 20 + 5 - 13 × 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**110 ÷ 20**__ + 5 - 13 × 9 = 153\n\n⇒ 5.5 + 5 - __**13 × 9**__ = 153\n\n⇒ __**5.5 + 5**__ - 117 = 153\n\n⇒ __**10.5 - 117**__ = 153\n\n⇒ -106.5 ≠ 153\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) : + and -\n\nGiven equation is : 110 ÷ 20 + 5 × 13 - 9 = 153\n\nAfter interchanging the two signs the equation is as follows : 110 ÷ 20 - 5 × 13 + 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**110 ÷ 20**__ - 5 × 13 + 9 = 153\n\n⇒ 5.5 - __**5 × 13**__ + 9 = 153\n\n⇒ __**5.5**__ - 65 __**+ 9**__ = 153\n\n⇒ __**14**____**.5 - 65**__ = 153\n\n⇒ -50.5 ≠ 153\n\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷ and +****\".**",
